                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>KPI cards show the latest month (September 2026). </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Reporting</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> = facility sent data that month. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Compliant</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> = reporting with an error rate of 3% or less. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Quarantined</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> = invalid rows set aside and excluded from the KPIs. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Silent</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> = no data for 30+ days.</run>
